  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental funds only. Beginning/ending cash are the cash basis fund balances rolled forward on p4 (ending = cash 6,412,813 + investments 1,741,665); ending_investments informational. Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement of cash basis assets and fund balances (p3, Total column), equal to the Statement of Net Position (p1). Statement Taxes 3,530,420 split by fund name: Inheritance Fund 542,240 inheritance tax, Visitors' Promotion Fund 6,955 lodging tax; remainder 2,981,225 unlabeled. Detail: General Fund and major fund budget schedules (pp5-7); 12 nonmajor funds from the combining statement Total Nonmajor Funds column (p12) instead of the one-line nonmajor budget schedules (pp8-10). Nonmajor Public Works 15,358 is the Weed Control Fund (natural resources/conservation). Read pages 1-12 of 12 Balances are the printed \"Cash basis fund balances - beginning / ending\" rows, recorded as fund balance like this county's other years (2026-11-19)."
